num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Board diligence checklist: index licence and renewal contingency**\n\n**Contract terms**\n- Term, renewal, and termination triggers (change of control, breach, index discontinuation)\n- Notice periods and any wind-down/tail-licence period, which vary and aren't standard\n- Fee escalators, MFN, exclusivity, sublicensing, assignment\n- Methodology-change rights, consultation duties, liability caps, indemnities\n\n**Naming dependencies**\n- Trademarked index names in fund name, ticker, marketing\n- Names Rule (35d-1) implications of a rename or index switch\n- Prospectus, SAI, listing amendments; shareholder communications\n\n**Affiliated-information issues**\n- Whether the provider is affiliated (self-indexing)\n- Firewalls, information barriers, code of ethics, rebalance-information controls\n- Exemptive-relief and listing-rule conditions\n\n**Contingency**\n- Feasibility and cost of a substitute index (not guaranteed)\n- Tracking-error, tax, transaction impacts\n- Whether a shareholder vote is required\n- Fallbacks: liquidation, merger, or conversion to active\n\nHave counsel confirm all items against the actual documents.","ttft_ms":1775,"type":"result","duration_ms":4448,"uuid":"8a91df24-deb4-478f-839d-744e800797eb","ttft_stream_ms":1227,"time_to_request_ms":58,"first_content_frame_ms":1228,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
